//www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4x+y+1=0</annotation></semantics></math></span></p></div></div><p><span class=\"fin\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x-4y+16=0</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></p><p>مثال 2: المار بـ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(7,-9),(3,3)</annotation></semantics></math></span> عمودي على <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x+ky-16=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> : <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"fin\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=-6</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></p><p>مثال 3: المستقيم <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x+3y=6</annotat